      }
    },
    "Words saved under two forms, like “gleam” and “gleaming”, show here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hier erscheinen Wörter, die in zwei Formen gespeichert sind, etwa „gleam“ und „gleaming“."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aquí aparecen las palabras guardadas en dos formas, como «gleam» y «gleaming»."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“gleam” ve “gleaming” gibi iki biçimde kaydedilen kelimeler burada görünür."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words saved under two forms, like gleam and gleaming, are found and merged on request, history and all." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wörter, die in zwei Formen gespeichert sind, etwa gleam und gleaming, werden gefunden und auf Wunsch samt Verlauf zusammengeführt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las palabras guardadas en dos formas, como gleam y gleaming, se encuentran y se combinan si lo pides, con todo su historial."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "gleam ve gleaming gibi iki biçimde kaydedilen kelimeler bulunur ve istersen geçmişiyle birlikte birleştirilir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words that sound alike — read and red — can be heard as each other. That's the recogniser, not always you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gleich klingende Wörter – read und red – können verwechselt werden. Das liegt an der Erkennung, nicht immer an dir."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las palabras que suenan igual (read y red) pueden oírse una por otra. Es cosa del reconocimiento, no siempre tuya."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sesteş kelimeler (read ve red gibi) birbiri yerine duyulabilir. Bu her zaman senin hatan değil, tanımanın sınırı."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words waiting for review come first; new ones are mixed in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zuerst kommen die fälligen Wörter; neue werden eingestreut."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Primero van las palabras que esperan repaso; las nuevas se intercalan."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Önce tekrar bekleyenler gelir, yeni kelimeler araya karışır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words you know" : {
